      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "A subclass of <a href=\"../../../messaging/simp/annotation/support/SimpAnnotationMethodMessageHandler.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.messaging.simp.annotation.support\"><code>SimpAnnotationMethodMessageHandler</code></a> to provide support\nfor <a href=\"../../bind/annotation/ControllerAdvice.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.web.bind.annotation\"><code>ControllerAdvice</code></a> with global <code>@MessageExceptionHandler</code> methods.",
